#: src/book_meta_fix/cli.py:129
msgid ""
"Apply the identity gate: a MISSING_ISBN/YEAR/COVER book whose "
"author+title are confirmed against its content counts as OK (not broken)."
" Default on, consistent with organize/analyze. --no-accept-missing keeps "
"the pure detector verdict (no content reads; the historic fast report)."
msgstr ""

#: src/book_meta_fix/cli.py:130
msgid ""
"Audit: also verify books the detectors marked OK against their content. "
"Reads every OK book's file (slower). A MISMATCH (or UNCERTAIN, see --no-"
"strict-verify) is then counted as broken."
msgstr ""

#: src/book_meta_fix/cli.py:131
msgid ""
"With --verify-ok: only treat a clear MISMATCH as broken. By default "
"UNCERTAIN is too."
msgstr ""

